  "$comment": "C34 enrichment sidecar (nested repeatable groups probe). slc-stand-ratio, 'Financial ratio'. Forces: (1) NESTED repeatable groups — RSG1 (1..n, a reporting period) contains RSG1/RSG1 (1..n, one block per ratio type); (2) REQUIREMENT values inside those arrays (ratio type CODE, definition, minimum). The top-level RG1 1..n is the per-lot scoping, flattened here as in C31 (lotIdentifiers is a leaf-level array). Instance model: periods[] each { period, ratios[] }, ratios[] each { ratioType, definition, minimumRatio }.",

